+**Global Constraints:**
+- Must use Bun as the package manager and runtime.
+- Must use local assets from `public/assets/` without external hotlinks.
+- Brand colors: Primary Orange (`#FF6B00` / `#E8501E`), Deep Dark (`#222222`), Clean Light Surface (`#F8F9FA`).
